§§ `Entries about property`

`a chair` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS TRUE, `it is ground` IS FALSE, `it is built on ground` IS FALSE, `it is planted in ground` IS FALSE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS FALSE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS FALSE)
`bare ground` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS TRUE, `it is ground` IS TRUE, `it is built on ground` IS FALSE, `it is planted in ground` IS FALSE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS FALSE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS FALSE)
`a building on the ground` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS TRUE, `it is ground` IS FALSE, `it is built on ground` IS TRUE, `it is planted in ground` IS FALSE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS FALSE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS FALSE)
`a tree planted in the ground` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS TRUE, `it is ground` IS FALSE, `it is built on ground` IS FALSE, `it is planted in ground` IS TRUE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS FALSE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS FALSE)
`a lift shaft fixed for good` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS TRUE, `it is ground` IS FALSE, `it is built on ground` IS FALSE, `it is planted in ground` IS FALSE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS TRUE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS FALSE)
`a machine bolted down but detachable` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS TRUE, `it is ground` IS FALSE, `it is built on ground` IS FALSE, `it is planted in ground` IS FALSE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS TRUE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS TRUE)
`a detachable cabin standing on the ground` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS TRUE, `it is ground` IS FALSE, `it is built on ground` IS TRUE, `it is planted in ground` IS FALSE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS FALSE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS TRUE)
`a debt` MEANS (`A thing of property` WITH `it is tangible` IS FALSE, `it is ground` IS FALSE, `it is built on ground` IS FALSE, `it is planted in ground` IS FALSE, `it is attached to ground permanently` IS FALSE, `it is a detachable fixture` IS FALSE)

